Source: nakedavp
Section: games
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Michal Slonina <michal.slonina@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake, g++, libsdl3-dev, libopenal-dev, libgl1-mesa-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/michalslonina/NakedAVP

Package: nakedavp
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Aliens versus Predator (NakedAVP) engine source port
 An open-source engine port of Aliens versus Predator Gold (Rebellion
 Developments, 1999-2000), rebuilt against SDL3/OpenAL/OpenGL.
 .
 Game data is NOT included and must be supplied separately from an
 original CD, GOG, or Steam install of AvP Gold - this package only
 provides the engine binary, a desktop entry and an icon.
